---
import { Stethoscope, Brain, FileSignature, ShieldCheck, Users, Clock3 } from 'lucide-react';
---
<section class="container-j py-16 md:py-20">
  <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold md:text-5xl">Muito além de uma chamada de vídeo</h2>
  <div class="mt-12 grid auto-rows-[minmax(200px,auto)] gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
    <article class="card flex flex-col justify-between p-8 md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-jopi-ice-2">
      <span class="badge w-fit bg-jopi-blue/10 text-jopi-blue"><Stethoscope size={14} /> Corpo clínico</span>
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-6xl text-jopi-blue md:text-7xl">30+</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold md:text-3xl">especialidades médicas online</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-md font-body text-jopi-text-2">Médicos com CRM ativo, treinados para atendimento remoto com protocolos clínicos padronizados.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="card p-7">
      <span class="badge bg-jopi-purple-soft text-jopi-purple"><Brain size={14} /> Saúde mental</span>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold">Psicologia e psiquiatria online</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 font-body text-sm text-jopi-text-2">Sessões semanais com acompanhamento contínuo.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card p-7">
      <span class="badge bg-jopi-green-soft text-jopi-green-dark"><FileSignature size={14} /> Documentos digitais</span>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold">Receitas e atestados válidos</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 font-body text-sm text-jopi-text-2">Assinatura digital ICP-Brasil, aceitos em farmácias.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card p-7">
      <span class="badge bg-jopi-yellow-soft text-[#9a6b00]"><Clock3 size={14} /> 24/7</span>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold">Atendimento a qualquer hora</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 font-body text-sm text-jopi-text-2">Madrugada, feriado ou fim de semana.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card p-7">
      <span class="badge bg-jopi-rose-soft text-jopi-rose"><Users size={14} /> Família</span>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold">Dependentes na mesma conta</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 font-body text-sm text-jopi-text-2">Inclua filhos e familiares, com pediatria online.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card p-7">
      <span class="badge bg-jopi-blue/10 text-jopi-blue"><ShieldCheck size={14} /> Segurança</span>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-bold">Prontuário protegido</h3>
      <p class="mt-1 font-body text-sm text-jopi-text-2">Criptografia e conformidade com a LGPD.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
